cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite this work, cite it as below."
title: "Killer Bee — persona and agent-team packs for Buzz"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-06
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sauloduttra/killer-bee"
url: "https://sauloduttra.github.io/killer-bee/"
authors:
  - family-names: Duttra
    given-names: Saulo
abstract: >-
  A cross-community catalog of persona and agent-team packs for Buzz
  (Block's Nostr-native agent platform). Emits the agent and team
  snapshots the Buzz desktop imports natively, compiles a response
  threshold profile (Hill function; no algorithmic novelty claimed) to
  native runtime fields, and publishes a static, verifiable catalog with
  per-artifact sha256. Every upstream claim is cited file:line against a
  pinned commit and checked by a second reader.
keywords:
  - buzz
  - nostr
  - agents
  - persona
  - response-threshold-model
